## Headline

kpi Q3 revenue | $2,134,000 | +8.4% vs Q2 | good
kpi Q3 operating profit | $375,000 | 17.6% margin | good
kpi Trailing 4 quarters revenue | $7,700,000
kpi Trailing 4 quarters profit | $1,117,000 | 14.5% margin

Q3 revenue is up 8.4% on Q2 and 15.9% on Q4 2025.

